&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is held in a standard containment unit at site-36.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is a bag made out of plastic with a brown and black thing that look’s like a rotten banana inside of it. SCP-5129 generates SCP-5129-1 out of nowhere about 100 times a day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5129-1 are small flying insects that resemble flies.&lt;/p&gt;
